  //  ### USE THE FOLLOWING PATCHES TO TWEAK INDIVIDUAL STRUCTURES/STRUCTURE SETS ###
  //
  //
  //    ignore_structure          -  Structure file will not be altered in any way.
  //    ignore_structure_type     -  Original structure type will not be altered.
  //    ignore_water_restriction  -  Structure will be allowed to spawn on/under the water, including rivers and lakes.
  //    ignore_terrain_adaptation -  Structure terrain adaptation will not be normalized to beard_thin.
  //    ignore_flatness_check     -  Structure will not be flagged with flatness_check_wide by default.
  //    flatness_check_wide       -  Large structures will only be allowed to spawn on reasonably flat terrain.
  //    flatness_check_narrow     -  Small structures will only be allowed to spawn on reasonably flat terrain.
  //    check_y_level             -  Normalizes the allowed y level for underground structure spawns. Adapts to mods that altered world height.
